# Sprint-004 Completion Walkthrough — Human Typing Engine & Production UI Integration

## Executive Summary

The **Human Typing Engine UI Integration** has been successfully designed, implemented, wired to `HumanTypingEngine`, tested, and packaged into the portable standalone application bundle (`dist/batmanoverlay/batmanoverlay.exe`).

The placeholder Typing Panel shell has been replaced with a full production-grade Typing Control Panel (`src/ui/typing_panel.py`).

---

## Production Typing UI Features Implemented

### 1. Header Toolbar
- **Status Indicator Badge**: Reactive pill displaying engine state (`READY`, `COUNTDOWN`, `ACQUIRING`, `PREVIEW WAIT`, `TYPING`, `PAUSED`, `COMPLETED`, `CANCELLED`, `TARGET VALIDATION FAILED`, `ERROR`).
- **Start Typing Button**: Primary accent action button triggering text simulation.
- **Pause / Resume Button**: Live pause control toggling thread execution lock.
- **Stop / Emergency Abort (ESC) Button**: Immediate global emergency cancellation.

### 2. Main Input & Live Execution Column (Left)
- **Input Text Area**: Multi-line text editor with placeholder instructions, live line count, word count, character count, estimated duration calculator, and clear text action.
- **Live Countdown Card**: Visual timer countdown bar (`10s... 9s... 8s...`) displayed during countdown phase with countdown cancel button.
- **Live Typing Progress Card**: High-precision progress bar displaying progress percentage and step counter (`Step 342 / 1,284 (26.6%)`).

### 3. Target Acquisition & Configuration Column (Right)
- **Target Information Card**: Displays dynamic target window information acquired at `T = 0s`:
  - Target Window Title (e.g. `Notepad - Draft.txt`)
  - Target Process Name (e.g. `notepad.exe`, `chrome.exe`)
  - Target Control Class (e.g. `Edit`, `Scintilla`, `Document`)
  - Window Handle HWND (e.g. `0x00010024`)
  - Manual Target Acquisition test button.
- **Engine Controls Card**:
  - **Typing Speed (WPM)**: Slider & spinbox (`20` to `300 WPM`, default `60 WPM`).
  - **Start Delay**: Dropdown selector (`0s (Immediate)`, `3s`, `5s`, `10s (Default)`, `15s`, `30s`).
  - **Typo Mistake Rate**: DoubleSpinBox (`0%` to `10%`, default `2%`).
  - **Show Preview Confirmation**: Checkbox toggling target preview modal at `T=0s`.
  - **Paste Threshold**: Auto-paste fallback limit (`5,000` chars default).

### 4. Target Acquisition Preview Modal (`TargetPreviewDialog`)
- Displayed after countdown and acquisition at `T=0s` (if preview mode enabled).
- Shows Window Title, Process Name, Control Class, Character Count, and Estimated Duration with `[ Start Typing ]` and `[ Cancel ]` buttons and a "Do not show again" checkbox.

