## Manual QA Instructions

To test the integrated Typing Engine UI:

1. Launch `dist/batmanoverlay/batmanoverlay.exe`.
2. Click the **Typing** icon (keyboard icon on sidebar) to open the Human Typing Engine panel.
3. Paste or type text into the **Input Text area**.
4. Adjust typing parameters if desired (Speed WPM, Start Delay, Preview Toggle).
5. Click **Start Typing**.
6. Switch to your desired editable text editor (e.g. Notepad, VS Code, Browser, ChatGPT) and place the text cursor (caret) inside the editable field before the countdown reaches zero.
7. Observe target window acquisition, preview modal confirmation (if enabled), and automated character-by-character typing execution!
